Description: Provides high-level modeling functions to define and train
    models using the 'torch' R package. Models include linear, logistic,
    and multinomial regression, multilayer perceptrons, modern neural neural 
    networks, and the pretrained tabular foundational models such as 'TabICL' 
    and 'TabPFN'.
